OL,3,GNEWSABletchley Park to cut jobs after
OL,4,Adrop in visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FBletchley Park has announced plans to
OL,7,Fcut up to 18 posts after a fall in
OL,8,Fvisitor numbers.
OL,10,FThe museum occupies the former secret
OL,11,Fbase near Milton Keynes where World War
OL,12,FTwo codebreakers, including Alan
OL,13,FTuring, worked to crack German codes.
OL,15,FThis week, Bletchley Park Trust's 105
OL,16,Femployees were told of proposals to cut
OL,17,Fstaffing costs by about 12%.
OL,19,FThe trust said it has "experienced
OL,20,Flower visitor numbers in a challenging
OL,21,Feconomic environment" and had exhausted
OL,22,Fother cost-saving options.
